  IF cr_id IS NULL THEN RETURN; END IF;

<hr />
<p><strong>Effect</strong> The monster attempts a melee Strike against the triggering creature. If the attack is a critical hit and the trigger was a manipulate action, the monster disrupts that action. This Strike doesn''t count toward the monster''s multiple attack penalty, and its multiple attack penalty doesn''t apply to this Strike.</p></p>', 'OGL', FALSE, 'Pathfinder Bestiary', 'attack-of-opportunity', 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<p>A graveknight can only be permanently destroyed by obliterating its armor (such as with Disintegrate), transporting it to the Forge of Creation, or throwing it into the heart of a volcano.</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, 'Pathfinder Bestiary', 'graveknight-rejuvenation', 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<p>The graveknight can use this ability once every 1d4 rounds.</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, 'Pathfinder Bestiary', 'graveknight-devastating-blast', 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<hr />
<p><strong>Effect</strong> The graveknight attempts a Strike as their armor flashes with sinister power that spurs allies to violence. After the Strike, allies who can see the graveknight can use a reaction to Step or Stride, but they must end this movement in a space adjacent to an enemy. One ally of the graveknight''s choice can instead use a reaction to Strike.</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, '', NULL, 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> DC 39 save</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Onset</strong> 1 hour</p>
<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> Doomed 1 and cannot remove the armor (1 day)</p>
<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> Doomed 2, the creature''s Speed is reduced by 10, and cannot remove the armor (1 day)</p>
<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> dies and transforms into the armor''s graveknight.</p>
<p>Effect: Graveknight''s Curse</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, 'Pathfinder Bestiary', 'graveknight-graveknights-curse', 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<hr />
<p>The graveknight summons a supernatural mount as per Marvelous Mount, heightened to a level equal to half the graveknight''s level.</p>
<p>Unlike <em>phantom steed</em>, the steed''s AC and saving throw bonuses are all 4 lower than the graveknight''s, and the steed has one-third the graveknight''s Hit Points (rounded down).</p>
<p>If the steed is destroyed, the graveknight must wait 1 hour before using this ability again.</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, 'Pathfinder Bestiary', 'graveknight-phantom-mount', 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
  BEGIN
