<hr />
<p><strong>Effect</strong> The dragon spits a glob of caustic salt water at the creature. The creature takes 5d6 acid damage (DC 30 save). On a failure, the concentrate action is disrupted.</p>', 'OGL', FALSE, '', NULL, 'common') ON CONFLICT (name, action_type, n_of_actions, category, md5(COALESCE(description, '__NULL__')), license, remaster, source, slug, rarity) DO UPDATE SET name = EXCLUDED.name RETURNING id INTO v_action_id;
<hr />
<p><p>A creature that first enters the area must attempt a Will save.</p>
<p>Regardless of the result of the saving throw, the creature is temporarily immune to this monster''s Frightful Presence for 1 minute.</p>
<hr />
<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected by the presence.</p>
